{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受描写不如X细腻，尤其缺少随乐句推进的音色、力度、呼吸和悬停变化，部分音乐过程被压缩成了概括性的情绪词。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分区让叙事和感受各有位置，普通观众可以先抓住人物在想什么，再顺手扫过感受提示；叙事句也更完整地交代了行为背后的顾虑和因果，前后心理变化比较连贯。X的【】突出处理很有利于抓取每段要点，而且到时出现的感受能更细致地贴合音乐变化，但感受信息有时过密，容易分散对人物叙事的注意力。整体我选Y，因为听音乐时先看懂这个人在经历什么、为什么这样变化，比获得更多但略显拥挤的感受提示更重要。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d403338d-6130-497d-b874-672b86fc6ba8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001811313932Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:20:04.378177+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ec25911d30763931f97713294ff0cb2cff89feb38b6d5b533a2c2e9a6cf17fc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too